00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:48,920
 the question that your boss wants you to answer.

48
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:52,760
 Outputs are usually the reason you're building the model in the first place.

49
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:57,840
 There's one caveat here, and that is that you don't usually choose states or inputs

