00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:25,200
 or the elements in our system work irrespective of how they're connected.

77
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:31,720
 For example, in the mass-spring depth system, the CCR for a spring is F equals K delta.

78
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:36,360
 And notice that this equation doesn't tell you anything about how that spring is connected.

79
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:40,480
 It doesn't tell you whether the spring is intention or compression in which way you should

