00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:46,800
 And it doesn't tell you how you should calculate delta, the deformation of the spring.

82
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:50,840
 It doesn't tell you whether you should consider a positive delta to be a stretch or a

83
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:51,840
 squish.

84
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:52,840
 And that's the point.

85
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,600
 CCR should be transferable.

86
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:58,600
 I should be able to take a CCR from one model and move it over to another model that

87
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:02,200
 uses the same component with no loss of generality.

