00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:51,720
 the physics of the problem or consulting a textbook, in general the responsibility is going

102
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,720
 to be on you.

103
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,360
 All right, step five.

104
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:58,360
 And this I think is probably the most important part of your model, the system structural

105
00:05:58,360 --> 00:06:00,640
 relations, the SSRs.

