00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,040
 that are attached to it.

111
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:23,040
 SSRs are where the real thinking happens.

112
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:27,640
 This is where you're using the physics of the problem to describe how the system works.

113
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:31,440
 As we learn about the different domains over the next couple of weeks, I'm going to teach

